        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko kuko Kristo yababarijwe mu mubiri, mwitwaze nk’ibirwanishwa ben’ uyo mutima: kuk’ ūbabarijwe mu mubiri aba amaze kureka icaha, ",
          "type": "text",
